
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CineWorld - Movie Website</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
        }

        header {
            background: #1f2937;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        nav h1 {
            color: #facc15;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #facc15;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7f1d1d, #111827);
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 35px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .search {
            padding: 12px;
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 400px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
        }

        .movies {
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .movies h2 {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #facc15;
        }

        .movie-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .movie-card {
            background: #1f2937;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .movie-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
        }

        .movie-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 320px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .movie-info {
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .movie-info h3 {
            color: #facc15;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .movie-info p {
            margin: 8px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .rating {
            color: #facc15;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .review {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e11d48;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background: #be123c;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #1f2937;
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }

            .movies {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .movie-card img {
                height: 350px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <nav>
            <h1>🎬 CineWorld</h1>
            <div>
                <a href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#movies">Movies</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>Discover Your Favorite Movies</h2>
        <p>Explore movies, ratings, reviews and exciting stories.</p>
        <input type="text" class="search"
               placeholder="Search your favorite movie...">
    </section>

    <section class="movies" id="movies">
        <h2>Popular Movies</h2>

        <div class="movie-grid">

            <div class="movie-card">
                <img src="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Gxv8gSFCU0XGDykEGv7zR1n2ua.jpg"
                     alt="Oppenheimer Poster">

                <div class="movie-info">
                    <h3>Oppenheimer</h3>
                    <p><b>Genre:</b> Biography, Drama</p>
                    <p><b>Release:</b> July 21, 2023</p>
                    <p><b>Cast:</b> Cillian Murphy, Emily Blunt</p>
                    <p><b>Synopsis:</b> The story of scientist J. Robert
                    Oppenheimer and the development of the atomic bomb.</p>
                    <p class="rating">8.3 / 10</p>
                    <p class="review">Critics: "A powerful cinematic experience."</p>
                    <a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt15398776/"
                       class="button" target="_blank">View Movie</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="movie-card">
                <img src="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pdfLvkbY9ohJlCjQH2CZjjYVvJ.jpg"
                     alt="Dune Part Two Poster">

                <div class="movie-info">
                    <h3>Dune: Part Two</h3>
                    <p><b>Genre:</b> Sci-Fi, Adventure</p>
                    <p><b>Release:</b> March 1, 2024</p>
                    <p><b>Cast:</b> Timothee Chalamet, Zendaya</p>
                    <p><b>Synopsis:</b> Paul Atreides joins the Fremen
                    and begins his journey toward destiny.</p>
                    <p class="rating">8.5 / 10</p>
                    <p class="review">Critics: "An epic visual masterpiece."</p>
                    <a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt15239678/"
                       class="button" target="_blank">View Movie</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="movie-card">
                <img src="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg"
                     alt="Deadpool and Wolverine Poster">

                <div class="movie-info">
                    <h3>Deadpool & Wolverine</h3>
                    <p><b>Genre:</b> Action, Comedy</p>
                    <p><b>Release:</b> July 26, 2024</p>
                    <p><b>Cast:</b> Ryan Reynolds, Hugh Jackman</p>
                    <p><b>Synopsis:</b> Deadpool teams up with Wolverine
                    on an unexpected multiverse adventure.</p>
                    <p class="rating">7.5 / 10</p>
                    <p class="review">Critics: "A fun superhero adventure."</p>
                    <a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt6263850/"
                       class="button" target="_blank">View Movie</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="movie-card">
                <img src="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cqNxx0GxF0bflZmeSMuL5tnGzr.jpg"
                     alt="Interstellar Poster">

                <div class="movie-info">
                    <h3>Interstellar</h3>
                    <p><b>Genre:</b> Sci-Fi, Drama</p>
                    <p><b>Release:</b> November 7, 2014</p>
                    <p><b>Cast:</b> Matthew McConaughey, Anne Hathaway</p>
                    <p><b>Synopsis:</b> Astronauts travel through a wormhole
                    to search for a new home for humanity.</p>
                    <p class="rating">8.7 / 10</p>
                    <p class="review">Critics: "An unforgettable space journey."</p>
                    <a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0816692/"
                       class="button" target="_blank">View Movie</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="movies" id="about">
        <h2>About CineWorld</h2>
        <p>CineWorld is a movie discovery website where users can
        explore films, discover genres, read movie descriptions
        and check ratings.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 CineWorld | Movie Lovers Community</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

